# madcide default theme (AST-2): classification -> style spec, one pair
# per line (class first, then the spec — JOE's vocabulary: bold dim
# italic underline blink inverse, a colour black..white, bg_<colour>;
# bold-as-bright gives the 16-colour foreground model). An unlisted
# class renders normal. Schemes are sibling *.theme files, swapped with
# ^K T by name.
keyword yellow
type green
string red
number magenta
comment cyan
function bold blue
